## Phase 2: Cinematic Fullscreen Player + Real Lyrics

### Files to REWRITE

#### [MODIFY] FullscreenPlayer.jsx
- Full redesign: vinyl record art + needle animation
- Word-level karaoke that zooms in on active line
- Particle system behind the album art (JS Canvas)
- Bottom controls: redesigned with larger play button, waveform seek bar
- Right panel: karaoke OR "Up Next" queue toggle

#### [MODIFY] services/lyrics.js
- Add 4th source: Genius via a CORS proxy approach
- Change strategy to TRUE RACE — first synced result wins immediately (don't wait for all)
- Add `fetchLyricsWithWordTiming()` — syllable-level timing interpolation
- Target: <500ms cold start, <50ms cached

#### [MODIFY] PlayerBar.jsx
- Redesign: taller (100px), better spacing
- Add frequency visualizer bars (animated CSS)
- Waveform-style seek bar

