## Verification Plan

### Build Test
- `npm run build` — ensure zero errors
- `npm run dev` — live preview

### Feature Tests (via browser)
1. Open app → verify animated Panda logo appears
2. Play a song → verify ambient colors shift
3. Open fullscreen → verify vinyl animation + lyrics load in <1s
4. Test seek → verify lyrics jump to correct position  
5. Test sleep timer → verify fade animation
6. Test mobile swipes → verify gesture navigation

---

## Open Questions

> [!WARNING]
> **Lyrics Coverage**: The `musixmatch` API requires a proxy to avoid CORS. Options:
> - A) Use a public CORS proxy (fast to implement, may rate-limit)
> - B) Keep the 3-source LRCLib+lyrics.ovh system but optimize the RACE strategy
> - C) Add Genius as a 4th source via a free scraping proxy
>
> **Recommendation**: Start with option B (optimize existing) + add option C. If coverage is still <70%, escalate to A.

> [!NOTE]
> **Gesture Controls**: Swipe detection on mobile requires either a library (react-spring, framer-motion) or a lightweight custom hook. We'll build a custom 50-line hook to keep bundle size small.

> [!NOTE]  
> **Particle System**: True canvas particles are CPU-heavy. We'll use CSS-only particle animations (pseudo-elements + keyframes) that look beautiful but consume zero extra CPU.

